sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant P as Platform (agent)
  participant B as Business (UCP merchant)
  participant TS as Trusted Surface
  participant CP as Credential Provider
  P->>B: GET /.well-known/ucp
  B-->>P: capabilities include dev.ucp.common.payment.ap2_mandate, keys[]
  P->>B: create or update checkout
  B-->>P: checkout with ap2.merchant_authorization (detached JWS, JCS)
  P->>P: verify merchant signature before showing the checkout
  P->>TS: Checkout and Payment Mandate Content
  TS-->>P: signed mandates (SD-JWT with key binding)
  P->>CP: Payment Mandate
  CP-->>P: token carrying the Payment Mandate
  P->>B: complete with ap2.checkout_mandate and payment.instruments[*].credential.token
  B-->>P: order, or an error such as mandate_required or mandate_scope_mismatch
